{
  "bookId": "hero-211203",
  "id": "bond-28509",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28509001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "又带了这么多有趣的小玩具来找我，说吧，你有什么目的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没什么，只是意外收集到这些修理工具，就想到你会喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "赏金猎人从不相信这世界上会有白捡的午餐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你这么大方送东西给我，很难让我不怀疑你啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "所以，老实点说出来吧，你真正的目的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可我真的只是单纯想送给你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过既然你这样问了，那你觉得我还能有什么目的呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "比如喜欢我，想要借此接近我之类的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳咳咳……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "怎么，被我说中心虚了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然不是……如果实在要说有什么目的的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那也顶多是想瞻仰下泉小姐享受机车骑行的飒爽英姿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "啧，那还不是和我说的一个意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "如果是你想看的话，我不介意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28509015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不过阿尔贝尔跑起来可是很快的，追不上可别怪我嘲笑你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
